# VFX-13 curve + gradient inputs in the .dfx stack: Campfire Flames "Color Over Life" gradient white->orange->transparent and "Size Over Life" curve 1->0, edited through the same stop functions the stack widgets call (one set = one undo step), saved, reopened, then a second gradient edit undone back to the saved one
Дано run Open "VFX/Campfire.dfx"
Дано set Transport.Playing 0
Дано set Transport.Time 1.5
Когда set Flames.ParticleUpdate.SizeOverLife.Scale.Keys 0,1,1,1,0,0
Когда set Flames.ParticleUpdate.ColorOverLife.Scale.Keys 0,1,1,1,1,0.5,1,0.45,0.1,1,1,1,0.3,0,0
Тогда 0_edit Stack: SizeOverLife.Scale is a plot 1->0 with two key rows, ColorOverLife.Scale a white->orange->transparent gradient bar with three stop rows; preview flames go orange and shrink to nothing with age
Когда run Document "Save this document"
Когда run Document "Close Campfire"
Когда run Open "VFX/Campfire.dfx"
Дано set Transport.Playing 0
Дано set Transport.Time 1.5
Тогда 1_reopen after reopen the same gradient (white->orange->transparent, three stops) and size curve (1->0), same flames look
Когда set Flames.ParticleUpdate.ColorOverLife.Scale.Keys 0,0.3,0.5,1,1,1,0.2,0.3,1,1
Тогда 2a_second_edit the gradient is now blue (two stops), flames blue
Когда run Action Undo
Тогда 2_undo the gradient is back to white->orange->transparent with three stops, flames orange again as in 1_reopen
